      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Point",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Kiangsu and Chekiang Primary School, the first Mandarin‑medium school in Hong Kong, opened in North Point in 1953 by Shanghainese immigrants.",
